   171	                   intermediate return values that earlier nested-call arguments
   172	                   left on the stack. For multi-argument calls that are preceded
   173	                   by such temporaries the base is mis-computed (off by one),
   174	                   so nested calls used as arguments (e.g. add(double(3), triple(2)))
   175	                   read the wrong stack slots and produce wrong results. */
   176	                frame->local_start = vm->sp - func->param_count;
   177	                vm->ip = func->addr;
